  "instructions": [
    "heat the peanut-free soy sauce, fish sauce, and rice vinegar in a small saucepan until warm.",
    "soffritto ingredients should be cut into small pieces and sautéed until fragrant.",
    "add the ground pork and cook until no longer pink, breaking it up as it cooks.",
    "add the tofu and cook until golden brown.",
    "add the comte cheese and stir until melted.",
    "add the soffritto mixture to the cheese mixture and stir to combine.",
    "season with black pepper and cilantro.",
    "serve immediately over steamed rice.",
    "garnish with additional cilantro if desired.",
    "serve warm.",
    "keep the stew warm in the lacquerware bowl for up to 30 minutes."
